<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP, THIRD ROUND.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP, THIRD ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third round, second leg results in the Spanish Cup on Thursday:</p>
<p> Deportivo Coruna    2  Sevilla		0 aet</p>
<p>(2-2 on aggregate, Deportivo win 3-1 on penalties)  Lleida		  1   Hercules	    0</p>
<p>(first-leg game postponed because of bad weather)</p>
<p>Played on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Real Betis	    3   Granada	     0</p>
<p>(Betis win 4-0 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Athletic Bilbao     2    Villareal	  2</p>
<p>(Athletic win 3-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Sporting Gijon	2    Espanyol	   2</p>
<p>(Espanyol win 6-3 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Logrones		2    Celta Vigo	 2</p>
<p>(Celta win 4-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Compostela	    3    Oviedo	     0</p>
<p>(Compostela win 3-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Rayo Vallecano	3    Osasuna	    1</p>
<p>(Rayo win 5-4 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Racing Santander    1    Zaragoza	   0</p>
<p>(Racing win 2-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Valladolid	    0    Real Madrid	2</p>
<p>(Real win 4-1 on aggregate)</p>
</text>
